      "message": "feat(ui): report door with prefilled GitHub issue and clipboard screenshot\n\nThe status strip gains a Report door beside the Debug info door. It\nopens a window with a title field, two kind buttons that open the\nbrowser on a prefilled GitHub new-issue URL (title, body and the bug /\nenhancement label filled in), and a Copy screenshot button that puts a\nCPU-raster picture of the document on the clipboard. The body embeds\nthe Debug info report (#157).\n\nThe repository gains a blank issue template and a config.yml enabling\nblank issues: GitHub's prefill query applies only to a blank template.\nThe act-report glyph is an original SVG master.\n\nPinned by report_tests (7), the shell_structure and\ntree_rows_badges_and_actions_are_svg_mastered structural pins.\n\nFixes #1696",
