      "message": "fix(ui): paint the report screenshot's floor for its own camera\n\nThe GUI test found the screenshot's ground grid wrong: dark scratch\nlines over the part. world::collect's overlay grid is framed for the\nlive camera, and raster() drew every overlay line with no depth test.\n\nThe shot now builds its own floor: the viewport's grid law (nice_step\nspacing, GRID_MAJOR_EVERY, the cubed rim fade) at a 40 px wanted\nspacing, light inks on a light ground, drawn through a new depth-tested\nCanvas::ground_line before the parts, gated on show_world_axes and\ncentred on the parts' XY bounds. The scene overlay's grid copy is\ndropped.\n\nPinned by raster::tests::ground_lines_take_the_viewports_floor_law and\nthe grid-ink assertions in the_screenshot_paints_the_document.\n\nRefs #1696",
