      "message": "Merge main into issue/1696-report-button\n\nResolved conflicts by keeping both sides where each added lines:\n\n- shell.rs: keep super::report::window (this PR's Report door) and\n  super::post_dialog::window (main's); drop super::debug_info::window,\n  which main (#2262) replaced with a docked Tab::DebugInfo => debug_info::draw.\n- structural.rs: keep the Report door strip assertion and main's\n  shows(&status) + query_by_label('Debug info').is_some(); drop the\n  branch's 'p'-scoped status-line rect and Debug-info rect assertions\n  (debug info is docked on main now; p is not in scope).\n- state.rs: keep both report_open/report_title (this PR) and\n  frame_rate (main).\n- report_tests.rs: drop the debug_info::window call (no such fn on\n  main); debug_info::report is still used.\n\nTargeted gate: report 17/17, structural 19/19, clippy clean,\ncargo test -p camcraft-ui -p camcraft-app --lib --no-run green.",
